{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suika Sprunki Edition</strong> is a vibrant arcade puzzle game inspired by the classic Suika formula, but with the unmistakable madness of the Sprunki universe. Drop character heads into a container and watch them bounce, collide, and merge into strange, evolving forms. What starts as a simple mechanic quickly becomes a thrilling challenge of timing, precision, and strategy. Don\u2019t let the box overflow\u2014score high and unlock even weirder evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: as your score climbs, the game begins to shift. The cheerful rhythm stutters, the atmosphere darkens, and before you know it, you\u2019ve slipped into <strong>Horror Mode</strong>, where familiar faces twist into something uncanny and the music begins to press on your nerves. It\u2019s the same game\u2014but seen through a distorted mirror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.poster.avif?t=1754636992\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.webm?t=1754636992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886860/extras/98c58bbc38cfeef69df063f1a27ceb1b.mp4?t=1754636992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inside you\u2019ll find:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Cross-platform leaderboard: fight for the top spot no matter where you play<br>\u2013 Beloved Sprunki characters: merge, explode, and watch them evolve<br>\u2013 A soundtrack that sticks with you: from playful tunes to unsettling hums<br>\u2013 A bold and slightly unhinged visual style: mesmerizing from the first drop</p>","achievements":